<table role="presentation" align="left" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="381" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 381px; float: left;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" height="472.031" valign="top" width="381" class="st-equal-height" style="height: 472.031px;"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="mob-ps-0" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Hello and welcome to the latest edition of <strong><span style="color: #147bd1;">On The Fly</span></strong>, Flywire’s quarterly newsletter, where we bring you the latest updates, insights, and success stories from our Education partners across Australia and New Zealand.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">In this edition, we’ll share key insights, best practices, and exciting developments from Flywire that can help enhance efficiencies and improve the admissions and payment experience for students and institutions.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Thank you for your continued trust in Flywire—I look forward to staying connected and strengthening our partnership in the months ahead. </span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Let’s dive in!</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><em><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Angela CostaRita<br />Director of Sales and Client Services, ANZ<br />Flywire</span></em></p> </td> 
</tr> 
