<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="hero-img st-dynamic-828-2" style="width: 100%;"><a href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/partner-spotlight-flywire-and-xetta-simplify-international-payments-for-universities-across-australia-and-asia-pacific-strengthening-their-long-standing-collaborative-relationship?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q2clientnewsletter" target="_blank" style="display: block;"><img border="0" valign="top" width="640" src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/j7u85h69p0/en_us/images/666a89a257e01-1718258082.3599.png" alt="URL" title="" class="st-mobile-width-constraint" style="border: 0px; display: block; width: 640px; max-width: 100%;" /> </a></td> 
