<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">Admissions teams save 35,000 hours with StudyLink’s English</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">Verification feature</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Saving two minutes of processing time per application doesn’t sound like much but, when you consider the number of international students applying to higher education institutions across the globe, it’s a saving that really adds up.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />Since StudyLink’s English language test verification integration was launched in 2023, admissions teams have saved over <span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>45,000</strong></span> hours of valuable time. It all leads to efficiency gains for admissions teams so they can spend more time providing better outcomes and experiences for future students.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong><span style="color: #223341;"><em>“Thank you for this great development! No more logging into different systems and flicking between screens. One click and the test result is there... magic!” -&nbsp; Linda Pham, UTS College</em></span></strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">Discover how StudyLink’s integration with IELTS, TOEFL, Duolingo, and Pearson enables admissions teams to verify English language test results with just one click!</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
