<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 30px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 32px; padding-bottom: 20px; width: 100%;"> <p style="text-align: center; margin: 0px;">APAIE 2025 Recap: Flywire in Action</p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">The Flywire team had an incredible time at APAIE 2025! A huge thank you to everyone who stopped by the Flywire and StudyLink booth, it was a pleasure connecting with you.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">APAIE is always an amazing opportunity for international educators to come together, strengthening connections across the Asia-Pacific region and beyond.</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">It was fantastic meeting you and discussing how Flywire and StudyLink can support and streamline the student journey, from recruitment to payments and beyond.&nbsp;</p> </td> 
