</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">The international education market has experienced some dramatic developments this year. Australia, Canada, the U.K., and the U.S. are still the top destinations, but students are looking elsewhere too, the latest <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://www.flywire.com/resources/3-ways-to-support-education-agents-in-a-shifting-international-education-landscape?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=q2clientnewsletter"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>ICEF Agent Voice report shows</u></strong></span></a>.</p> </td> 
